e=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="1644" width="600" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gd80" value="[A2_reprint a lost paper ticket]" style="text;html=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=nowrap;autosize=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="1990" width="600" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nt171" value="A3: decoded text continues at step 9; without camera permission: &quot;Không truy cập được camera. Vui lòng nhập mã vé.&quot;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="412" width="600" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nt172" value="A4: an exchanged ticket (UC-20) shows its new seat; the new ticket of the booking is printed instead. A5: a counter ticket (UC-19) counts as printed at sale, so only a reprint is possible." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="1056" width="640" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nt173" value="BR-36-01: look up by ticket code or check code (never by booking ID); any ticket shows the whole booking. BR-36-02: printable only if the booking is Paid, the ticket is Upcoming, the showtime is not cancelled, and now is between 24 hours before the start and the end. BR-36-03 / 04: each ticket is printed once; reprints need a reason and are logged. BR-36-07: an open shift is required; printing never changes money or ticket status (no check-in)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="2340" width="700" height="84" as="geometr